# Structured delivery (Superpowers-inspired)

For non-trivial tasks:

1. **Analyze** — goal, constraints, touched areas, risks (`analyze-task`)
2. **Plan** — short ordered steps; note tests/docs impact
3. **Execute** — one step at a time; minimal diffs
4. **Verify** — run the project’s typecheck/tests/build as appropriate
5. **Record** — update docs/ai or CHANGELOG_AI when behavior changes

Skip ceremony for trivial one-line fixes; never skip verify when logic changed.
